    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "1979746721241698529",
      "url": "https://x.com/dost_pagasa/status/1979746721241698529",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/dost_pagasa/status/1979746721241698529",
      "text": "Heavy Rainfall Warning No. 5 #NCR_PRSD\nWeather System: Tropical Storm RAMIL\nIssued at: 11:00 AM, 19 October 2025(Sunday)\n\nYELLOW WARNING LEVEL: Nueva Ecija, Tarlac, Cavite, Batangas, Laguna, Quezon, Bulacan(Dona Remedios Trinidad, San Miguel, Norzagaray), Rizal(Jala-Jala, Pililla, Tanay, Binangonan, Cardona, Morong, Baras) and Zambales(Candelaria, Santa Cruz, Masinloc).\nASSOCIATED HAZARD: FLOODING in flood-prone areas.\nMeanwhile, light to moderate with occasional heavy rains affecting Pampanga, Metro Manila, Bataan, Rizal(Antipolo, Rodriguez, San Mateo, Angono, Cainta, Taytay, Teresa), Bulacan(Angat, Bustos, Baliuag, San Rafael, San Ildefonso, Balagtas, Bocaue, Bulakan, Calumpit, Malolos, Meycauayan, San Jose del Monte, Guiguinto, Hagonoy, Marilao, Obando, Pandi, Paombong, Plaridel, Pulilan, Santa Maria) and Zambales(Olongapo, Subic, Botolan, San Marcelino, Cabangan, Iba, Palauig, Castillejos, San Antonio, San Felipe, San Narciso) which may persist within 3 hours.\nThe public and the Disaster Risk Reduction and Management Offices concerned are advised to MONITOR the weather condition and watch for the next warning to be issued at 2:00 PM today.\n\nFor more information and queries, please call telephone numbers 8927-1335 and 8927-2877 or log on to https://t.co/59mTpZJq1n.",
